### 1.3 QSR, fuel and pharmacy

- **MyMacca's Rewards** — Points earned per dollar at McDonald's Australia; redemptions are a fixed menu of items (e.g. a small fries at the lowest tier). No cash equivalent; effective value is calculated against menu price. Verify current points-per-item table and tier structure.
- **7-Eleven My 7-Eleven app** — Primarily a fuel-price-lock app rather than a points program in the traditional sense; the "fuel lock" feature lets users lock the lowest price within a radius for up to 7 days. There is a redemption/coupon component but limited "points balance" to track.
- **Chemist Warehouse / My Chemist** — No major points program historically; loyalty has been catalogue-driven discounting. Verify whether anything new launched 2024–2026.
- **Priceline Sister Club** — Points-based program; spending earns points that convert to dollar-off vouchers at set thresholds.

### 1.4 Hotels (popular in Australia)

- **Accor Plus / ALL Accor Live Limitless** — Australia is one of Accor's largest markets. Points are earned per €1 spent (variable per status). Reward Nights cost a variable points + cash amount. Accor Plus is the paid membership tier that bundles a free night + dining discounts; very popular in AU.
