- **IHG One Rewards** — Dynamic; typical ~0.5–0.7¢ per point.
- **Hilton Honors** — Dynamic; typical ~0.5¢ per point; "Points & Money" usually best value.
- **World of Hyatt** — Smaller Australian footprint, but high-value points (~1.7–2¢) per Point Hacks analysis.

